      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>New MacBook arrived 8/4. Clean setup, no migration assistant this time.</div><div><br/></div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>macOS updates, FileVault on</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Homebrew</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>brew install git gh node pnpm uv jq ripgrep fd tmux</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>git config user.name / user.email, new ssh key -&gt; GitHub (personal + Mathetic-PBC org)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>iTerm2 + zsh config from dotfiles repo</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>VS Code + settings sync</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Claude Code (npm i -g), log in</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Obsidian, open the vaults from iCloud</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>1Password, Arc, Slack, Zoom, Linear</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>FL Studio 2025 reinstall + license, copy packs from external SSD</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>Time Machine to the external SSD (it's full, need a new one)</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>Garmin Express? (or just the phone app)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>trackpad: tap to click, three-finger drag (accessibility settings)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Dock: autohide, remove everything</div><div><br/></div><div>Old Mac: wipe after the move, sell or give to Sam.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
